CHANGELOG
=========

[2.0.0] - 2026-07-20
--------------------
- Replace ad-hoc API with /api/v1 contract (root_id + root-relative paths)
- SQLite FTS index, pins, recent, pairing sessions, trash metadata
- Soft-delete to trash (30-day recovery) instead of immediate unlink
- Optimistic concurrency via document revision (if_match_revision)
- Mobile pairing QR (60s one-time exchange)
- Desktop Web client updated to /api/v1 only; pairing UI
- Cache-Control: no-store on document and asset responses
- See docs/API_V1.md and docs/MIGRATION_V1.md

